06

Key results — when & why delays happen

What the numbers say

    Peaks in July (>28% delayed) and May (~26%); October most reliable (~13%).
    Delays compound through the day: Morning 14% → Evening 28.5% (Overnight ~10%).
    Late-aircraft + carrier issues dominate delay minutes — weather is a minor share.
    Frontier (F9) least reliable (>27%); Hawaiian (HA) & Republic (YX) the most reliable.

