08

Limitations, ethics & recommendations

Limitations

    Streaming is a simulated batch replay, not true real-time ingestion.
    Local mode limits genuine horizontal scaling.
    Single-year data — patterns may shift across years.

Ethical & social

    Carriers & airports are named — rank fairly, separating controllable vs weather/ATC causes.
    Transparency of method and data quality before decisions.
    Aggregate, non-personal data, but governance still applies (Kitchin, 2014).

Recommendations

    Add turnaround buffers to afternoon/evening schedules.
    Invest in gate, ground & turnaround efficiency over weather focus.
    Build IT redundancy & offline backups for crew/scheduling systems.

